    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibition of refusing to attend a conference after notice.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(5) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person has been given a notice under subsection (3) requiring the person to attend a conference; and  (b) the person refuses or fails to comply with the requirement.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "Penalty: 10 penalty units.";
